<item><title>Tanzania signs €175 million in French loans for water, food and dairy</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-in-french-loans-for-water-food-4b1de0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-in-french-loans-for-water-food-4b1de0/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The three agreements include €90 million for Lake Victoria water and sanitation, plus financing for urban food infrastructure and smallholder dairy.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:01:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-in-french-loans-for-water-food-4b1de0/share.jpg" length="43789" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-in-french-loans-for-water-food-4b1de0/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
